1. Project Title and Brief Description
Project Management System

The Project Management System is a full-stack web application developed to simplify project planning, task management, team collaboration, and workflow tracking within organizations and academic environments. The system provides a centralized platform where users can create projects, assign tasks, manage teams, monitor progress, and receive automated notifications.

The application is built using the PERN Stack (PostgreSQL, Express.js, React.js, Node.js) and integrates modern tools such as Clerk Authentication, Inngest Background Jobs, and Neon PostgreSQL Database for secure authentication, scalable backend processing, and efficient data management.

